lse,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+ZMvA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7eaa8183-1243-4d44-a6a9-c8dc59c6ad9d","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"await (callback発行する処理)\nawait onCallback()\n\nで下が準備する前に callback 終わっちゃうとすれ違う","ts":"1633526174.099500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"swWaK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5acc9f50-24f5-4154-a15a-d32d56cbcdf2","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"あ～～～。もし不発率高かったら一箇所 source 側に変更するのでそれで治るかもです。 (onCallback)","ts":"1633526138.098700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WqV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce545f75-74d7-49d7-8f2c-e9712bd475f2","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"お、ddc.vimからtabnineを使うと、coc-tabnineのときに発生した変な誤爆が発生しなくなったのがうれしい。","ts":"1633525271.098100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vG4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05a50a54-05e6-4e8e-a691-f16015f43815","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"ddc-tabnineをWindowsのgvimに入れたら、tabnineのバイナリが入らなかったので、適当にダウンロードしたバイナリを突っ込んで動くようにしたけど、これでいいんだろうか。","ts":"1633525208.097400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"50VwY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32b621b9-568f-4194-b796-59167dad00bc","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/skanehira/denops-translate.vim\u003e\ntranslate.vimをdenopsに移植した","ts":"1633524044.096000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"skanehira/denops-translate.vim","id":1,"title":"skanehira/denops-translate.vim","text":"Translate languages","fields":[{"title":"Language","value":"TypeScript","short":true},{"title":"Last updated","value":"a minute ago","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"otxu","count":4,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U72TB62UF","U02BDFBM620","U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"95Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4dd3e6b2-a50a-4731-acc4-497f93e3c985","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"上記、もし試してくるという方がいたら、 `ddc-{n,}vim-lsp` ユーザーの方いらっしゃいましたら、よかったらお願いします！\n\n```[[plugins]]\nrepo = 'LumaKernel/ddc.vim'\nrev = 'oncallback'\n\n[[plugins]]\nrepo = 'LumaKernel/ddc-nvim-lsp'\nrev = 'oncallback'```\n```[[plugins]]\nrepo = 'LumaKernel/ddc.vim'\nrev = 'oncallback'\n\n[[plugins]]\nrepo = 'LumaKernel/ddc-vim-lsp'\nrev = 'oncallback'```","ts":"1633522181.095100","thread_ts":"1633522181.095100","reply_count":5,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["U02BDFBM620","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"euXA9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"627e8c5e-adcb-4f3a-b73a-b2e16f133b78","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"うーん、これはプルリクエストを見てみたい","ts":"1633503959.092000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["US5UW1UNB"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nBa4A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f60532bf-17ae-447e-943c-9a47c7492c4e","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"`ddc.vim` に今の `refresh_candidates()` の代替として\n`ddc#callback(id [, payload])` みたいな vim 側の関数と、source (filter) 側の `gatherCandidates()` 等で使える `this.onCallback(id [, timeout]): Promise\u0026lt;Payload\u0026gt;` みたいな関数を用意することを考えている。 (`Payload = unknown`)\n\n利点は `async/await` の自然な構文で使えること (コールバックを使った実装が簡易になる) や、再呼び出しによって候補の更新がちらつくことの解消、manual complete でも使える。\n\n`resolve` を持ち回すことで実現可。メモリリークに関する考慮事項は増える。これは `timeout` で解決すればよいかなと。\n\n\u003c@U7JL1UKKL\u003e さんの意見を聞いておきたい。","ts":"1633503669.091500","thread_ts":"1633503669.091500","reply_count":5,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U02BDFBM620"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iu1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a87d9adb-5a7e-462f-9d29-ff1667bea5ab","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"以下の設定で試用してみます．とりあえず，エラーとかは（当たり前だと思いますが）出ていないです．\n```Plug 'vim-skk/skkeleton'\nPlug 'hrsh7th/vim-vsnip'\nPlug 'hrsh7th/vim-vsnip-integ'\nPlug 'rafamadriz/friendly-snippets'\n\"Plug 'Shougo/ddc.vim'\n\"Plug 'shun/ddc-vim-lsp'\nPlug 'LumaKernel/ddc-vim-lsp', { 'branch': 'oncallback' }\nPlug 'LumaKernel/ddc.vim', { 'branch': 'oncallback' }\nPlug 'LumaKernel/ddc-file'\nPlug 'Shougo/ddc-around'\nPlug 'tani/ddc-fuzzy'```","ts":"1633523511.095300","thread_ts":"1633522181.095100","parent_user_id":"US5UW1UNB","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B1Tu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26e1f684-79b4-4d3c-9a91-2b8a0f775522","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"お、ありがとうございます。補完が出るかすらわかっていないのでそれだけでも教えていただけると助かります！","ts":"1633524012.095500","thread_ts":"1633522181.095100","parent_user_id":"US5UW1UNB","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3GB7Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36FBEC8E-A966-4D56-8FED-9C89F7277046","type":"message","user":"U0177HB2VA8","text":"ようやくissue が解決(真因は理解してないけど)なので人柱せていただきます！","ts":"1633527221.104400","thread_ts":"1633522181.095100","parent_user_id":"US5UW1UNB","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8go"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0b98671-01d5-41fa-8ef3-118068307df2","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"ありがとうございます。私もちょうど久しぶりに入れて試してみました。(vim-lsp)\nなんか赤いのがちらっと見える気がするな。","ts":"1633528151.105200","thread_ts":"1633522181.095100","parent_user_id":"US5UW1UNB","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0pR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18e734ca-1878-4e93-8a0e-e08d4fca573c","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"この on_complete_done_after がキラッと見えるなぁ。\nこれは feedkeys から来ているみたいだけどタイミングが変わったことによって見えてしまうようになったのかな。","ts":"1633528844.105400","thread_ts":"1633522181.095100","parent_user_id":"US5UW1